# A reply to one part of an answer: its pill in the draft and in the sent message, and the part it
# quotes, gone to and marked by a click on the sent pill once it is far up.
stage 1760 1000
window 1760 1000
replies reply-pill.json
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
project storefront shop
chat Wren
title "Order emails"
settle 4
front Wren
say "How do order emails go out?"
settle 8
say "Where does that live?"
settle 8
move 600,400 0.3
scroll 3000
settle 1
click 800,840
type "Why is"
move 800,313 0.3
move 1267,313 0.3
wait 0.5
click 1267,313
wait 0.5
type "on hold for that long?"
settle 1
snap reply-pill-draft
key enter
settle 8
move 800,500 0.3
scroll -6000
settle 1
snap reply-pill-sent
click 1012,595
wait 0.6
snap reply-pill-shown
